sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant G as WoW and addon
    participant F as SavedVariables file
    participant C as Companion
    participant API as Character workflow
    participant R as Readiness workflow
    G->>G: Capture visited character and save-scan completeness
    G->>F: Flush snapshot on reload, logout or exit
    C->>F: Read completed file without executing Lua
    C->>C: Validate format and retain stable snapshot identity
    C->>API: Upload with paired identity and observation time
    alt Network failure or unavailable service
        C->>C: Retain snapshot and retry with same identity
    else Duplicate or older snapshot
        API-->>C: Acknowledge without regressing current facts
    else New valid snapshot
        API->>API: Store provenance and observed character facts
        API->>API: Queue new claim or preserve existing ownership
        API->>R: Re-evaluate affected future signups and rosters
        API-->>C: Acknowledge successful sync
    end
